# 统一文本文件换行符为 LF，避免 Windows / macOS 协作时产生无意义 diff
# （最终仓库里所有文本文件都是 LF，Windows 检出时由 core.autocrlf 自动转换）
*               text=auto eol=lf

# 显式标记为文本
*.md            text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf
*.js            text eol=lf
*.mjs           text eol=lf
*.css           text eol=lf
*.html          text eol=lf
*.vue           text eol=lf
*.json          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
*.txt           text eol=lf
*.gitignore     text eol=lf
*.gitattributes text eol=lf
Dockerfile      text eol=lf

# 二进制
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jpeg          binary
*.gif           binary
*.webp          binary
*.ico           binary
*.svg           text eol=lf
*.mp4           binary
*.mkv           binary
*.webm          binary
*.mp3           binary
*.m4a           binary
*.aac           binary
*.opus          binary
*.part          binary

# GitHub Linguist：让前端构建产物与本机沙箱目录不参与语言统计
frontend/dist   linguist-generated
frontend/smoke-screenshots linguist-generated
# 大型不必要文件，GitHub 仍会保存但语言统计忽略
*.exe           binary
